{
  "info": {
    "name": "Luma - Promo & Diskon API",
    "description": "Collection lengkap untuk testing modul Promo/Diskon.\n\n**Cara pakai:**\n1. Jalankan request `Login` terlebih dahulu untuk mendapat token\n2. Token otomatis tersimpan di variable `access_token`\n3. Semua request promo sudah pakai Bearer token otomatis\n\n**3 Tipe Promo:**\n- `percentage` → Diskon Persentase\n- `fixed` → Diskon Nominal\n- `special_price` → Harga Spesial",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:4000/api"
    },
    {
      "key": "access_token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "promo_id",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{access_token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "Autentikasi - jalankan Login dulu sebelum test promo",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register (Owner)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"full_name\": \"Test Owner\",\n  \"username\": \"testowner\",\n  \"email\": \"owner@test.com\",\n  \"phone\": \"08123456789\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\",\n  \"role\": \"Owner\",\n  \"company_name\": \"PT Luma Test\",\n  \"agree\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/users/register",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["users", "register"]
            },
            "description": "Register user Owner baru. Jalankan sekali saja."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201 || pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (json.data && json.data.access_token) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', json.data.access_token);",
                  "        console.log('access_token saved from register');",
                  "    }",
                  "}",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Register berhasil', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 201]);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"owner@test.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/users/login",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["users", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Login untuk mendapat access_token. Token otomatis tersimpan di collection variable."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Login berhasil', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property('access_token');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "if (json.data && json.data.access_token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', json.data.access_token);",
                  "    console.log('access_token saved');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Promo - Create",
      "description": "Buat promo baru (3 tipe)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Tambah Promo - Diskon Persentase",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Diskon Akhir Tahun 10%\",\n  \"description\": \"Diskon 10% untuk semua produk di akhir tahun\",\n  \"discount_type\": \"percentage\",\n  \"discount_value\": 10,\n  \"max_discount\": 50000,\n  \"min_purchase\": 100000,\n  \"start_date\": \"2026-10-01\",\n  \"end_date\": \"2026-12-31\",\n  \"usage_limit\": 100,\n  \"active\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/promos",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["promos"]
            },
            "description": "Buat promo tipe **Diskon Persentase**.\n\n- `discount_value`: nilai persen (0-100)\n- `max_discount`: batas maksimal potongan (opsional)\n- `min_purchase`: minimal total belanja"
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Promo persentase berhasil dibuat', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "    pm.expect(json.status).to.eql('success');",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data.discount_type).to.eql('percentage');",
                  "    pm.expect(Number(json.data.discount_value)).to.eql(10);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "if (json.data && json.data.id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('promo_id', json.data.id);",
                  "    console.log('promo_id saved:', json.data.id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Tambah Promo - Diskon Nominal",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Potongan Rp 50.000\",\n  \"description\": \"Potongan langsung Rp 50.000 untuk pembelian minimal Rp 200.000\",\n  \"discount_type\": \"fixed\",\n  \"discount_value\": 50000,\n  \"min_purchase\": 200000,\n  \"start_date\": \"2026-10-01\",\n  \"end_date\": \"2026-11-30\",\n  \"usage_limit\": 50,\n  \"active\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/promos",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["promos"]
            },
            "description": "Buat promo tipe **Diskon Nominal**.\n\n- `discount_value`: nominal potongan harga tetap (Rp)\n- `max_discount`: tidak perlu (sudah fixed)\n- `min_purchase`: minimal total belanja"
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Promo nominal berhasil dibuat', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "    pm.expect(json.status).to.eql('success');",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data.discount_type).to.eql('fixed');",
                  "    pm.expect(Number(json.data.discount_value)).to.eql(50000);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Tambah Promo - Harga Spesial",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
